      <title>FreqDroid: Manage Your FreqTrade Bots From Your Phone</title>
      <link>https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 10:00:00 +0100</pubDate><author>me@codeskraps.com (codeskraps)</author>
      <guid>https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m excited to announce that &lt;a href=&#34;https://freqdroid.com/&#34;&gt;FreqDroid&lt;/a&gt; is now available on the Google Play Store. FreqDroid is a mobile client for &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.freqtrade.io/&#34;&gt;FreqTrade&lt;/a&gt;, the popular open-source cryptocurrency trading bot framework, bringing full bot management to your pocket.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;picture style=&#34;display: block; text-align: center; margin: 2rem auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 480px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/bot_comparison_hu_cfc8efccf48342cb.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 800px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/bot_comparison_hu_3a8774b26166ba6e.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(min-width: 801px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/bot_comparison_hu_ff452c46055977a1.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/freqdroid/bot_comparison_hu_ff452c46055977a1.jpg&#34; &#xA;      alt=&#34;FreqDroid multi-bot comparison dashboard&#34; &#xA;      width=&#34;400&#34; &#xA;      height=&#34;867&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;  &lt;/picture&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Weekly Weather v3: Radar Maps, New Settings, and Landscape Support</title>
