      <description>&lt;p&gt;Version 3 of &lt;a href=&#34;https://git.codeskraps.com/codeskraps/Weekly-Weather&#34;&gt;Weekly Weather&lt;/a&gt; is out, and it&amp;rsquo;s a significant update. The headline addition is an interactive radar map with animated precipitation overlays, but there&amp;rsquo;s a lot more packed into this release.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;picture style=&#34;display: block; text-align: center; margin: 2rem auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 480px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/weekly_weather_v3/screenshot1_hu_339c9c5977770ba0.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 800px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/weekly_weather_v3/screenshot1_hu_4f77ce9234d55bc1.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(min-width: 801px)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/weekly_weather_v3/screenshot1_hu_86404b662431890a.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;https://codeskraps.com/posts/2026/weekly_weather_v3/screenshot1_hu_86404b662431890a.jpg&#34; &#xA;      alt=&#34;Weekly Weather forecast screen&#34; &#xA;      width=&#34;400&#34; &#xA;      height=&#34;898&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;  &lt;/picture&gt;</description>
